e it moves."}, {"versions": ["y"], "text": "It stores energy by sleeping at underwater depths at which no other life-forms can survive."}, {"versions": ["omega-ruby"], "text": "Kingdra lives at extreme ocean depths that are otherwise uninhabited. It has long been believed that the yawning of this Pokémon creates spiraling ocean currents."}, {"versions": ["alpha-sapphire"], "text": "Kingdra sleeps on the seafloor where it is otherwise devoid of life. When a storm arrives, the Pokémon is said to awaken and wander about in search of prey."}, {"versions": ["sword"], "text": "With the arrival of a storm at sea, this Pokémon will show itself on the surface. When a Kingdra and a Dragonite meet, a fierce battle ensues."}, {"versions": ["shield"], "text": "Scales shed by this Pokémon have such a splendorous gleam to them that they’ve been given to royalty as gifts."}], "sprites_by_gen": {"generation-ii": {"crystal": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-ii/crystal/230.png", "shiny": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-ii/crystal/shiny/230.png"}, "gold": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-ii/gold/230.png", "shiny": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-ii/gold/shiny/230.png"}, "silver": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-ii/silver/230.png", "shiny": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-ii/silver/shiny/230.png"}}, "generation-iii": {"emerald": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-iii/emerald/230.png", "shiny": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-iii/emerald/shiny/230.png"}, "ruby-sa